:"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"g5ogvPhw3PSobtaZFkdEXg","review_id":"Txs5NbX-_SwRRm0S2Jcmog","date":"2012-03-20T21:51:21","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9359745979309082,"text_excerpt":"We were visiting the area, and needed an afternoon pick me up. We stopped in and this place is quaint, and the food and drinks heavenly delicious. The owner was sweet and friendly. I had the iced latte, and a red velvet cupcake, it was moist, not overly sweet and the cream cheese frosting was perfect, not too sweet, perfectly balanced. My girlfriend has the chocolate chip cookie, her complaint was not enough chips, but she really likes chocolate. We ventured there another day and had the chocolate overload cupcakes, another perfectly balanced sweet, and again the iced lattes which were yummy and refreshing. I will plan on visiting , if I am ever in this area again."},{"business_id":"g5ogvPhw3PSobtaZFkdEXg","review_id":"NIL0ZFyC4Rkv9pyxgWk--w","date":"2017-09-22T19:37:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9323444366455078,"text_excerpt":"Went here today for the first time and ordered two different cupcakes. There were many to chose from as well as homemade truffles, gelato, cakes, etc. our cupcakes were very good but a bit to sweet for my taste. The atmosphere is comfortable and there are places to sit and relax while having coffee and a sweet treat. The cake video running while we were eating was very intriguing to watch. I would definitely go back but maybe this time try something other than a cupcake."},{"business_id":"g5ogvPhw3PSobtaZFkdEXg","review_id":"IsqmvmqIR7J2k-suGYhyQg","date":"2016-04-14T20:49:02","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9242586493492126,"text_excerpt":"I'm writing this review for three things Bittersweet offers: coffee, cupcakes and specialty made-to-order cakes. Let me start off by saying the coffee is delicious and the price point is good. The bakery isn't too small - I'd say around 7 or 8 tables, with two outside. They can be a little slow to make coffee when they're busy on weekends. But, hey, it's a weekend so I don't mind waiting. I had a chocolate cupcake of sorts from their pastry cake and it was absolutely delicious. Perfectly moist and the frosting was on point. Now, for the main deal. I was throwing my friend a baby shower for her twins. I had an idea of what I wanted, but could be swayed to do other things. I did have to cal..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"g5ogvPhw3PSobtaZFkdEXg","photo_id":"xP38GPzSJ_dHy-leEdbuDA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/xP38GPzSJ_dHy-leEdbuDA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8957310914993286},{"business_id":"g5ogvPhw3PSobtaZFkdEXg","photo_id":"ykxCGA3eVj_8VPZMJjCHmA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ykxCGA3eVj_8VPZMJjCHm